    <!-- Detection -->
    <s:String x:Key="Det.Title">Automatic chest detection</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Det.Warning">Experimental feature. The app only analyses the picture on screen (Windows Graphics Capture) at a low rate and looks for the golden burst of an opening chest near the crosshair. Game memory is never read, no DLLs are injected and Easy Anti-Cheat is not touched. Accuracy is not guaranteed: chests can be missed and false positives can happen (for example golden items or effects). Uncertain cases are queued for review.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Det.ModeHint">Analysis only runs in automatic or hybrid mode.</s:String>
